	"When you are done, have a look around the island. The welcome assembly is this afternoon, in the arena. I will find you out there.": "Cuando termines, date una vuelta por la isla. La asamblea de bienvenida es esta tarde, en la arena. Yo te busco por allá.",
	"A bed, a desk, and a wall for your best card. I have seen worse. I have lived in a card.": "Una cama, un escritorio y una pared para tu mejor carta. He visto cosas peores. He vivido en una carta.",
